==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|physics}} The [[static]] electric [[energy]] of a charged body.
# {{lb|en|physics}} The quantity of unbalanced positive or negative ions in or on an object; measured in [[coulomb]]s.
# {{lb|en|physics}} A [[quantum number]] of some [[subatomic particle]]s which determines their [[electromagnetic]] [[interaction]]s; by [[convention]] the [[electron]] has an electric charge of -1, the [[proton]] +1 and [[quark]]s have [[fractional]] charge.

